{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016144016946-1016_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261016153958\"/><p>肇事輕型飛機墜毀。（電視畫面）</p><p>澳洲新南威爾士省上獵人谷周五（16日）下午有一架輕型飛機墜毀，機上2人全部身亡。</p><p>應急部門於當地下午1時55分接報，到場後發現機上人士當場死亡。澳洲運輸安全局表示，涉事飛機是一架在休閒飛行器登記冊上的套件組裝飛機。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:00:05.049178+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:40:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T11:18:05.014828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:44.012982+00:00","content_hash":"5cce8d0fa13244aa9abed769c1df1ca7228182179308eab76601345bc3f94c9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}